<title>BELGIUM: EU says Anglo to cut Lonrho stake.</title>
<headline>EU says Anglo to cut Lonrho stake.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Wednesday that South Africa's Anglo American Corp had agreed to a Commission demand to cut its stake in Lonrho Plc to 9.99 percent from 27.5 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;This reduction is to be carried out within an agreed timetable should no other solution to the Commission's competition concerns be found,&quot; the EU executive said in a statement.</p>
</text>
